removes: the source hands the deployable its access token rather than its refresh token
packages: ./provider/gmail
tests: TestARotatedRefreshTokenIsHeldSentAndHandedOver TestARefreshThatDoesNotRotateKeepsTheToken TestAnAccessTokenIsUsedUntilItNearlyExpires TestTheSourceHoldsOnlyTheCredentialItIsGiven
scheduled-count: no

